### Interaction Flow Description

#### Flow 1 — User Authentication
```
User (Browser)
  │── opens SmartScribe URL (Vercel CDN serves React SPA)
  │── fills Login form / clicks "Sign in with Google"
  │
  ├─► [React Frontend] ──── POST /api/auth/login ──────► [FastAPI Backend]
  │                              (username, password)          │
  │                                                            ├─ verifies bcrypt hash
  │                                                            ├─ generates JWT (HS256)
  │                                                            └─► returns {access_token}
  │
  │◄── JWT stored in localStorage ──────────────────────────────
  └── User is redirected to /evaluate
```

#### Flow 2 — Google OAuth Authentication
```
User clicks "Sign in with Google"
  │
  ├─► [Google OAuth Popup] ── user consents ──► Google returns access_token to Frontend
  │
  ├─► [React Frontend] ─── POST /api/auth/google ─────► [FastAPI Backend]
  │                            {credential: access_token}        │
  │                                                              ├─ calls googleapis.com/oauth2/v3/userinfo
  │                                                              ├─ verifies token server-side
  │                                                              ├─ creates/finds user in SQLite
  │                                                              └─► returns {access_token (JWT)}
  └── User logged in with JWT
```

#### Flow 3 — Essay Evaluation
```
User writes essay → clicks "Evaluate"
  │
  ├─► [React Frontend] ─── POST /api/evaluate ──────────► [FastAPI Backend: main.py]
  │                         Authorization: Bearer <JWT>          │
  │                         {title, content}                     │
  │                                                              ├─ auth.get_current_user_id() ← validates JWT
  │                                                              ├─ ai.get_ai_evaluation(title, content)
  │                                                              │     └─► POST → OpenRouter LLM API
  │                                                              │           └─► returns JSON scores
  │                                                              ├─ db.save_essay() → SQLite INSERT
  │                                                              └─► {grammar, coherence, argumentation, feedback}
  └── Frontend renders score cards + AI feedback
```

#### Flow 4 — Dashboard
```
User navigates to Dashboard
  │
  ├─► [React Frontend] ─── GET /api/dashboard/stats ───► [FastAPI Backend]
  │                         Authorization: Bearer <JWT>          │
  │                                                              ├─ db.get_average_scores(user_id)
  │                                                              ├─ db.get_user_essays(user_id)
  │                                                              └─► {averages, recent_essays}
  └── Frontend renders progress charts and essay history
```

