### Component Interaction Summary

```
Frontend (Evaluate.jsx)
    │
    │  POST /api/evaluate
    │  Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    ▼
FastAPI Backend (main.py → evaluate_essay)
    │
    ├── auth.get_current_user_id()  ──► validates JWT ──► returns user_id
    │                                     [Auth Component]
    │
    ├── ai.get_ai_evaluation()      ──► OpenRouter API ──► JSON scores
    │                                     [AI Component]
    │
    └── db.save_essay()             ──► SQLite INSERT
                                          [Database Component]
```

